{"path":"/industries/insurance-insurtech/","slug":"industries__insurance-insurtech","kind":"industry","title":"Insurance Website Design on Webflow | Legency Media","description":"Webflow builds and AI visibility for insurers, MGAs and insurtechs: product pages that clear compliance first time, trust detail where a reviewer looks.","source":"live","stylesheets":["/_astro/global.Btqt_PqA.css","/_astro/Base.D9X9tJbq.css","/_astro/ConsentBanner.Bjqg_HPr.css","/_astro/FaqSection.BU63QfoB.css","/_astro/ServiceLayout.DWPKQstD.css"],"scripts":["/_astro/Nav.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BTi8Y4C0.js","/_astro/Footer.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.QLgbxcz6.js","/_astro/ConsentBanner.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BlWZOVqD.js","/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BUtqXeGZ.js","/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_1_lang.s69FG7Vr.js"],"mainHtml":"<section class=\"svc-hero\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"svc-hero__tex\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/secondary-hero.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm></div><div class=\"container svc-hero__inner\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Industries</span><h1 class=\"svc-hero__title\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Insurance &amp; Insurtech</h1><p class=\"svc-hero__sub\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Your buyers are brokers, carriers, reinsurers and enterprise risk teams, and they read the site before they take the call. We build insurance and insurtech sites where the product page explains the policy without a promise legal will strike, the licensing and security detail sits where a reviewer looks, and every per-market disclosure updates from one place.</p><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--blue\" href=\"/get-in-touch/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>Get in touch</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a></div></section><section class=\"section evo\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__head\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Where Deals Are Lost</span><h2 class=\"evo__heading\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Where an Insurance Site Loses the Buyer Before the Call</h2></div><div class=\"evo__grid\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__col\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__colhead\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"evo__kicker\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The Problem</span><span class=\"evo__coltitle\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Standard Agency</span></div><div class=\"evo__cards\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--light\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M6 6L18 6\"/><path d=\"M6 10H18\"/><path d=\"M13 14L18 14\"/><path d=\"M13 18L18 18\"/><path d=\"M2 21.4V2.6C2 2.26863 2.26863 2 2.6 2H21.4C21.7314 2 22 2.26863 22 2.6V21.4C22 21.7314 21.7314 22 21.4 22H2.6C2.26863 22 2 21.7314 2 21.4Z\"/><path d=\"M6 18V14H9V18H6Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Legal strikes the product page after launch</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>A policy page written to sell reads as a promise to pay. Compliance rewrites it after launch, the campaign window closes during the second pass, and the page that goes back up explains nothing a broker can act on.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--light\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M9 6L20 6\"/><path d=\"M3.80002 5.79999L4.60002 6.59998L6.60001 4.59999\"/><path d=\"M3.80002 11.8L4.60002 12.6L6.60001 10.6\"/><path d=\"M3.80002 17.8L4.60002 18.6L6.60001 16.6\"/><path d=\"M9 12L20 12\"/><path d=\"M9 18L20 18\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The carrier&#39;s reviewer cannot find the security page</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Before a carrier or reinsurer takes the call, someone on its risk team opens the site to check licensing, data handling and certifications. A badge in the footer with nothing behind it sends that person back with the box unticked.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--light\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M15 4V2M15 4V6M15 4H10.5M3 10V19C3 20.1046 3.89543 21 5 21H19C20.1046 21 21 20.1046 21 19V10H3Z\"/><path d=\"M3 10V6C3 4.89543 3.89543 4 5 4H7\"/><path d=\"M7 2V6\"/><path d=\"M21 10V6C21 4.89543 20.1046 4 19 4H18.5\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>One disclosure changes and forty pages fall behind</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Per-state and per-market wording lives in footnotes copied by hand across the site. When a regulator changes one line, the pages nobody remembered keep the old version, and the marketing lead hears about it from legal.</p></article></div></div><div class=\"evo__col\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__colhead\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"evo__kicker\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The Solution</span><span class=\"evo__coltitle evo__coltitle--brand\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><img src=\"/img/mark.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"evo__logo\" width=\"57\" height=\"57\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The Legency Approach</span></span></div><div class=\"evo__cards evo__cards--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/band-loop.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-us-lazyload=\"true\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm></div><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M8.5 11.5L11.5 14.5L16.5 9.5\"/><path d=\"M5 18L3.13036 4.91253C3.05646 4.39524 3.39389 3.91247 3.90398 3.79912L11.5661 2.09641C11.8519 2.03291 12.1481 2.03291 12.4339 2.09641L20.096 3.79912C20.6061 3.91247 20.9435 4.39524 20.8696 4.91252L19 18C18.9293 18.495 18.5 21.5 12 21.5C5.5 21.5 5.07071 18.495 5 18Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Product pages explain cover without promising it</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Triggers, exclusions and claims handling are written in language compliance has already approved, so the page clears review on the first pass and the launch keeps its date.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M14.2718 10.445L18 2M9.31612 10.6323L5 2M12.7615 10.0479L8.835 2M14.36 2L13.32 4.5M6 16C6 19.3137 8.68629 22 12 22C15.3137 22 18 19.3137 18 16C18 12.6863 15.3137 10 12 10C8.68629 10 6 12.6863 6 16Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Trust detail sits where a risk team looks</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Licensing, SOC 2, ISO 27001, data residency and subprocessors on one page that exists before anyone asks. The reviewer finds what they were sent for, and the site says the contract is safe to sign.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M5.21173 15.1113L2.52473 12.4243C2.29041 12.1899 2.29041 11.8101 2.52473 11.5757L5.21173 8.88873C5.44605 8.65442 5.82595 8.65442 6.06026 8.88873L8.74727 11.5757C8.98158 11.8101 8.98158 12.1899 8.74727 12.4243L6.06026 15.1113C5.82595 15.3456 5.44605 15.3456 5.21173 15.1113Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 21.475L8.88874 18.788C8.65443 18.5537 8.65443 18.1738 8.88874 17.9395L11.5757 15.2525C11.8101 15.0182 12.19 15.0182 12.4243 15.2525L15.1113 17.9395C15.3456 18.1738 15.3456 18.5537 15.1113 18.788L12.4243 21.475C12.19 21.7094 11.8101 21.7094 11.5757 21.475Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 8.7475L8.88874 6.06049C8.65443 5.82618 8.65443 5.44628 8.88874 5.21197L11.5757 2.52496C11.8101 2.29065 12.19 2.29065 12.4243 2.52496L15.1113 5.21197C15.3456 5.44628 15.3456 5.82618 15.1113 6.06049L12.4243 8.7475C12.19 8.98181 11.8101 8.98181 11.5757 8.7475Z\"/><path d=\"M17.9396 15.1113L15.2526 12.4243C15.0183 12.1899 15.0183 11.8101 15.2526 11.5757L17.9396 8.88873C18.174 8.65442 18.5539 8.65442 18.7882 8.88873L21.4752 11.5757C21.7095 11.8101 21.7095 12.1899 21.4752 12.4243L18.7882 15.1113C18.5539 15.3456 18.174 15.3456 17.9396 15.1113Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Disclosures update once and change everywhere</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Per-market wording lives in a shared component. Your team edits it in one place, every page carrying it updates, and the change record shows who changed what and when.</p></article></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section foundation\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><div class=\"foundation__head\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><div data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Built for the Category</span><h2 class=\"foundation__heading\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Four Things an Insurance Engagement Delivers</h2></div></div><div class=\"foundation__grid\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 12V5.74853C20 5.5894 19.9368 5.43679 19.8243 5.32426L16.6757 2.17574C16.5632 2.06321 16.4106 2 16.2515 2H4.6C4.26863 2 4 2.26863 4 2.6V21.4C4 21.7314 4.26863 22 4.6 22H11\"/><path d=\"M8 10H16M8 6H12M8 14H11\"/><path d=\"M17.9541 16.9394L18.9541 15.9394C19.392 15.5015 20.102 15.5015 20.5399 15.9394V15.9394C20.9778 16.3773 20.9778 17.0873 20.5399 17.5252L19.5399 18.5252M17.9541 16.9394L14.963 19.9305C14.8131 20.0804 14.7147 20.2741 14.6821 20.4835L14.4394 22.0399L15.9957 21.7973C16.2052 21.7646 16.3988 21.6662 16.5487 21.5163L19.5399 18.5252M17.9541 16.9394L19.5399 18.5252\"/><path d=\"M16 2V5.4C16 5.73137 16.2686 6 16.6 6H20\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Copy That Clears Compliance First Time</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Policy and product copy written for the review it will face, so launches stop waiting on a second pass and the campaign ships inside its window.</p></article><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M8.5 11.5L11.5 14.5L16.5 9.5\"/><path d=\"M5 18L3.13036 4.91253C3.05646 4.39524 3.39389 3.91247 3.90398 3.79912L11.5661 2.09641C11.8519 2.03291 12.1481 2.03291 12.4339 2.09641L20.096 3.79912C20.6061 3.91247 20.9435 4.39524 20.8696 4.91252L19 18C18.9293 18.495 18.5 21.5 12 21.5C5.5 21.5 5.07071 18.495 5 18Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>A Trust Page for the Reviewer Sent to Check</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Licensing, certifications and data handling placed where a carrier&#39;s or reinsurer&#39;s risk team will look for them, laid out as evidence.</p></article><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M5.21173 15.1113L2.52473 12.4243C2.29041 12.1899 2.29041 11.8101 2.52473 11.5757L5.21173 8.88873C5.44605 8.65442 5.82595 8.65442 6.06026 8.88873L8.74727 11.5757C8.98158 11.8101 8.98158 12.1899 8.74727 12.4243L6.06026 15.1113C5.82595 15.3456 5.44605 15.3456 5.21173 15.1113Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 21.475L8.88874 18.788C8.65443 18.5537 8.65443 18.1738 8.88874 17.9395L11.5757 15.2525C11.8101 15.0182 12.19 15.0182 12.4243 15.2525L15.1113 17.9395C15.3456 18.1738 15.3456 18.5537 15.1113 18.788L12.4243 21.475C12.19 21.7094 11.8101 21.7094 11.5757 21.475Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 8.7475L8.88874 6.06049C8.65443 5.82618 8.65443 5.44628 8.88874 5.21197L11.5757 2.52496C11.8101 2.29065 12.19 2.29065 12.4243 2.52496L15.1113 5.21197C15.3456 5.44628 15.3456 5.82618 15.1113 6.06049L12.4243 8.7475C12.19 8.98181 11.8101 8.98181 11.5757 8.7475Z\"/><path d=\"M17.9396 15.1113L15.2526 12.4243C15.0183 12.1899 15.0183 11.8101 15.2526 11.5757L17.9396 8.88873C18.174 8.65442 18.5539 8.65442 18.7882 8.88873L21.4752 11.5757C21.7095 11.8101 21.7095 12.1899 21.4752 12.4243L18.7882 15.1113C18.5539 15.3456 18.174 15.3456 17.9396 15.1113Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Disclosures Your Team Edits Without a Developer</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Per-market wording held in components, so a regulator&#39;s change goes live from one edit, with a change record behind it.</p></article><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M9 21H15M9 21V16M9 21H3.6C3.26863 21 3 20.7314 3 20.4V16.6C3 16.2686 3.26863 16 3.6 16H9M15 21V9M15 21H20.4C20.7314 21 21 20.7314 21 20.4V3.6C21 3.26863 20.7314 3 20.4 3H15.6C15.2686 3 15 3.26863 15 3.6V9M15 9H9.6C9.26863 9 9 9.26863 9 9.6V16\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>A Monthly Report the Board Can Read</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Search, AI citations and pipeline evidence in one format each month, so the spend defends itself while a long deal is still open.</p></article></div></div></section><section class=\"section dp\" data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5><div class=\"container dp__head\" data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5>Compliance on the Page</span><h2 class=\"dp__heading\" data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5>Carriers Read the Site Looking for a Reason to Stop</h2><p class=\"dp__sub\" data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5>Insurance website design starts with the reviewer. A carrier, reinsurer or enterprise risk team will open the site before the first meeting, and what they cannot find they assume is missing.</p></div><div class=\"container dp__cards\" data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5><h3 data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5>Licensing detail that reads as evidence</h3><p data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5>Which markets you are licensed in, under which entity, with the regulator named. A footnote written that way answers the reviewer's first question. A footnote that only says \"regulated\" invites a second one.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5><h3 data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5>Policy wording that survives review</h3><p data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5>A product page has to explain a policy without promising a payout. Written for the review it will face, it clears legal on the first pass. Written to sell, it gets rewritten after launch and ends up saying nothing a broker can use.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5><h3 data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5>A security page for the reviewer sent to check</h3><p data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5>SOC 2, ISO 27001, data residency and subprocessors on one page linked from every product page. K2 Group put us through a 36-question cyber due-diligence questionnaire and a client-side MSA before work started, and that questionnaire is the model for what a carrier's reviewer will ask of you.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5><h3 data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5>A change record for the regulator's question</h3><p data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5>Knowing which wording was live on which date matters more in insurance than in most sectors. A build with a change record answers the question a regulator or an auditor will eventually ask, and answers it without a search through old emails.</p></article></div></section><section class=\"section dp dp--alt\" data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5><div class=\"container dp__head\" data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5>Long Sales Cycles</span><h2 class=\"dp__heading\" data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5>Brokers Ask an Assistant Before They Ask a Provider</h2><p class=\"dp__sub\" data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5>A considered purchase, a cycle measured in quarters, and a buyer who starts by asking which providers even cover the peril. That is the shape of question an AI assistant now answers with a shortlist.</p></div><div class=\"container dp__cards dp__cards--three\" data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5><h3 data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5>The shortlist forms before the first call</h3><p data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5>When a broker asks which parametric or embedded providers cover a risk and the assistant names three, a provider it leaves out is off the list before anyone at that company knows the question was asked.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5><h3 data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5>Being wrong is worse than being absent</h3><p data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5>Assistants describe companies from stale sources, so an insurer can be named for a line it withdrew or a market it left. Measuring what is said each month is the only way to find that before a broker does.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5><h3 data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5>The measurement already runs for clients</h3><p data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5>ChannelSight, a client in another sector, is the most-cited domain in its AI answer set at 16 of 56 answers. Blueflame AI's citations are tracked monthly against its named competitors. The same panel runs for an insurer against the providers its brokers compare.</p></article></div></section><section class=\"caseband\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><div class=\"pixelated-scroll-transition\" data-pixelated-scroll-transition data-columns=\"24\" data-columns-tablet=\"18\" data-columns-mobile=\"10\" data-rows=\"8\" data-mode=\"reveal\" style=\"color:var(--bg)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"caseband__scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/band-loop.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-us-lazyload=\"true\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f></div><div class=\"container caseband__inner\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><div class=\"caseband__content\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><span class=\"label label--on-dark\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f>Case Study</span><span class=\"caseband__chip\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><img src=\"/img/partners/blueflame-2026.svg\" alt=\"Blueflame AI\" loading=\"lazy\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f></span><h2 class=\"caseband__heading\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f>Sold through enterprise procurement to regulated buyers.</h2><p class=\"caseband__text\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f>Blueflame AI sells agentic AI to investment firms whose risk teams read a vendor&#39;s site before the first call. The engagement has run 18+ months through enterprise procurement, a funding round and an acquisition by Datasite, with a monthly evidence report in one unchanging format throughout.</p><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--white\" href=\"/case-studies/blueflame-ai/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>View Case Study</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a></div><div class=\"caseband__media\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><img src=\"/img/case-studies/blueflame-photo-oct2026-1440.webp\" alt=\"Blueflame’s new homepage and logo on an Apple Studio Display in a city office.\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f></div></div></section><section class=\"ctaband\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><div class=\"ctaband__scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/band-loop.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-us-lazyload=\"true\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz></div><div class=\"container ctaband__inner\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><div class=\"ctaband__text\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><span class=\"label label--on-dark\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Start With What Buyers Are Told</span><h2 class=\"ctaband__heading\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Find Out What AI Assistants Tell Brokers About You</h2><p class=\"ctaband__body\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>A broker or risk manager asks an assistant which providers cover a peril before they ask a vendor, and assistants answer from stale sources. A call about what that means for your line of business, and how the measurement works.</p></div><div class=\"ctaband__side\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><ul class=\"ctaband__points\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><li data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Four engines asked the questions brokers and risk managers type</li><li data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Whether you are named for lines you still write, or markets you left</li><li data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>The licensing and security detail a reviewer will look for, and whether it is findable</li></ul><div class=\"ctaband__actions\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--white\" href=\"/schedule/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>Get Your AI Visibility Read</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a><a class=\"ctaband__quiet\" href=\"/aeo-agency/\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>How the measurement works</a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section faq\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__head\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Common Questions</span><h2 class=\"faq__heading\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Frequently Asked<br data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Questions</h2></div><div class=\"faq__list\" data-faq data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-0\" id=\"faq-btn-0\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Do you understand insurance compliance and regulator-safe wording?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-0\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-0\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Yes. Product pages, claims examples and disclosures are written for the compliance review they will go through, so pages clear it on the first pass and launches hold their dates. Cover is described by what triggers a payout and what is excluded, and words a regulated category cannot use never reach the draft.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-1\" id=\"faq-btn-1\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>How do you handle per-state or per-market disclosures on the site?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-1\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-1\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Each disclosure lives in a shared component tagged with the market it applies to. Your team edits the wording once, every page carrying it updates, and the change record shows who changed it and when. A regulator&#39;s change takes one edit, and a page that needs a market-specific footnote gets it by selecting the market.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-2\" id=\"faq-btn-2\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Where do SOC 2, ISO 27001 and licensing details belong on an insurtech site?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-2\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-2\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>On a trust page that exists before a carrier or reinsurer asks, linked from the footer and from every product page. It lays out licensing by market and entity, certifications, data residency and subprocessors as evidence the reviewer can copy into their own file, so the person sent to check finds what they were sent for.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-3\" id=\"faq-btn-3\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Have you built a website for an insurance company before?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-3\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-3\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Yes. Adaptive Insurance, a parametric insurer, runs its site on a shared component system we built from its Figma designs, with a monthly report to the marketing team. Its team adds and rearranges product pages without a developer. Blueflame AI, which sells to investment firms through enterprise procurement, has been retained for over 18 months.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-4\" id=\"faq-btn-4\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Our sales cycle runs over a year. What does the website do in that time?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-4\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-4\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>It answers the question each stakeholder brings during the cycle: the broker checking cover, the risk team checking licensing and security, the procurement lead checking the company is real. Search and AI citation tracking show each month who is finding the site and what they are told, so the board sees evidence while the deal is still open.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-5\" id=\"faq-btn-5\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Can our marketing team publish a new product page without a developer?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-5\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-5\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Yes. Pages are assembled from approved components, so a product manager fills in the cover, triggers and exclusions and the page carries the right disclosures and trust links by default. Layout, wording rules and legal footnotes are fixed inside the component, so a page cannot ship without them.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section>","inlineStyles":[".transition {\n          display: none;\n        }",".dp__grid[data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5]{gap:var(--sp-5);grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);align-items:center;display:grid}.dp__heading[data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5]{font-size:var(--h4);margin-bottom:var(--sp-3);max-width:24ch}.dp__text[data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5] p[data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5],.dp__sub[data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5]{font-size:var(--para-sm);max-width:56ch;margin-bottom:var(--sp-2)}.dp__note[data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5]{opacity:.7}.dp__head[data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5]{margin-bottom:var(--sp-4);max-width:64ch}.dp--alt[data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5]{background:var(--white)}.dp__cards[data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5]{gap:var(--sp-3);grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));display:grid}.dp__cards--three[data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5]{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))}.dp__card[data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5]{background:var(--white);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:var(--sp-4)}.dp--alt[data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5] .dp__card[data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5]{background:var(--bg)}.dp__card[data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5] h3[data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5]{font-size:var(--h6);margin-bottom:var(--sp-2);max-width:26ch}.dp__card[data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5] p[data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5]{font-size:var(--para-sm)}.dp__steps[data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5]{gap:var(--sp-2);list-style:none;display:grid}.dp__step[data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5]{gap:var(--sp-4);background:var(--white);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:var(--sp-4);grid-template-columns:max-content minmax(0,1fr);display:grid}.dp--alt[data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5] .dp__step[data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5]{background:var(--bg)}.dp__num[data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5]{font-family:var(--font-title);font-weight:500;font-size:var(--h6);color:var(--blue);line-height:1}.dp__step[data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5] h3[data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5]{font-size:var(--h6);margin-bottom:var(--sp-2)}.dp__step[data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5] p[data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5]{font-size:var(--para-sm);max-width:74ch}.dp__foot[data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5]{margin-top:var(--sp-3);font-size:var(--para-sm);opacity:.7;max-width:72ch}@media (width<=900px){.dp__grid[data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5],.dp__cards[data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5],.dp__cards--three[data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5],.dp__step[data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5]{grid-template-columns:1fr}.dp__step[data-astro-cid-mk3wnbn5]{gap:var(--sp-2)}}",".pixelated-scroll-transition{z-index:10;pointer-events:none;position:absolute;inset:auto 0 0}[data-pixelated-scroll-panel]{flex-direction:row;width:100%;display:flex}[data-pixelated-scroll-column]{flex-direction:column;flex:1;justify-content:flex-end;align-items:stretch;min-width:0;display:flex}[data-pixelated-scroll-pixel]{aspect-ratio:1;backface-visibility:hidden;will-change:opacity;background-color:currentColor;width:100%}[data-pixelated-scroll-transition][data-mode=reveal]{inset:0 0 auto}@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.pixelated-scroll-transition{display:none}}\nhtml.lenis,html.lenis body{height:auto}.lenis:not(.lenis-autoToggle).lenis-stopped{overflow:clip}.lenis [data-lenis-prevent],.lenis [data-lenis-prevent-wheel],.lenis [data-lenis-prevent-touch],.lenis [data-lenis-prevent-vertical],.lenis [data-lenis-prevent-horizontal]{overscroll-behavior:contain}.lenis.lenis-smooth iframe{pointer-events:none}.lenis.lenis-autoToggle{transition-behavior:allow-discrete;transition-property:overflow;transition-duration:1ms}\n.ctaband[data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz]{background:var(--black);color:var(--white);padding-block:var(--sp-6);position:relative;overflow:clip}.ctaband__scene[data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz]{z-index:0;pointer-events:none;opacity:.55;background:url(/img/tex-closer.png) 50%/cover no-repeat;position:absolute;inset:0}.ctaband__scene[data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz]:after{content:\"\";background:linear-gradient(100deg,#000000d9 0%,#0000008c 45%,#0003 100%);position:absolute;inset:0}.ctaband__inner[data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz]{z-index:1;gap:var(--sp-5);grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.1fr) minmax(0,1fr);align-items:center;display:grid;position:relative}.ctaband__heading[data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz]{font-size:var(--h3);max-width:18ch;margin-bottom:var(--sp-3)}.ctaband__body[data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz]{font-size:var(--para-sm);opacity:.85;max-width:48ch}.ctaband__points[data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz]{gap:var(--sp-2);margin-bottom:var(--sp-4);list-style:none;display:grid}.ctaband__points[data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz] li[data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz]{font-size:var(--para-sm);max-width:46ch;padding-left:1.7em;position:relative}.ctaband__points[data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz] li[data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz]:before{content:\"\";background:var(--lime);border-radius:2px;width:10px;height:10px;position:absolute;top:.42em;left:0}.ctaband__actions[data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz]{align-items:center;gap:var(--sp-3);flex-wrap:wrap;display:flex}.ctaband__quiet[data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz]{font-size:var(--para-sm);opacity:.8;border-bottom:1px solid #fff6;padding-bottom:2px;transition:opacity .25s}.ctaband__quiet[data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz]:hover,.ctaband__quiet[data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz]:focus-visible{opacity:1}@media (width<=900px){.ctaband__inner[data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz]{grid-template-columns:1fr}}@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ctaband__quiet[data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz]{transition:none}}\n.icon-chip[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga]{width:var(--icon-chip-size,48px);height:var(--icon-chip-size,48px);background:var(--blue);color:var(--white);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);flex-shrink:0;place-items:center;display:grid}.icon-chip--on-dark[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga]{background:#ffffff1a;border:1px solid #ffffff47}.icon-chip--bare[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga]{color:inherit;background:0 0;border:0}.icon-chip--muted[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga]{color:#201d1d8c;background:#201d1d0f;border:1px solid #201d1d1a}.icon-chip[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga] svg[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga]{width:58%;height:58%;display:block}.icon-chip--bare[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga] svg[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga]{width:100%;height:100%}"],"inlineModules":["document.querySelectorAll(`[data-faq]`).forEach(e=>{let t=e.querySelectorAll(`.faq__btn`);t.forEach(e=>{e.addEventListener(`click`,()=>{let n=e.getAttribute(`aria-expanded`)===`true`;t.forEach(e=>e.setAttribute(`aria-expanded`,`false`)),e.setAttribute(`aria-expanded`,String(!n)),window.setTimeout(()=>window.dispatchEvent(new Event(`resize`)),500)})})});"]}